  "title": {
    "zh": "监控驱动的自动恢复",
    "ja": "監視による自動復旧",
    "en": "Monitoring-driven recovery"
  },
  "story": {
    "zh": "2035 年，Nova：Shadow Fault 制造了新的故障。任务：监控驱动的自动恢复。诊断资源并恢复云城。",
    "ja": "2035年、Nova：Shadow Fault が障害を発生。任務：監視による自動復旧。リソースを調べ都市を復旧せよ。",
    "en": "2035. Nova: Shadow Fault has caused another incident. Mission: Monitoring-driven recovery. Diagnose the resources and restore the city."
  },
  "lesson": {
    "zh": "Alarm 触发安全函数，函数通过 IAM 角色与 SSM 文档恢复应用，下一采样窗口回到 OK。",
    "ja": "Alarm が安全な関数を呼び、IAM と SSM で復旧して次の窓で OK に。",
    "en": "An alarm invokes a safe function; IAM and SSM constrain remediation, and the next sample returns to OK."
  },
